  "brain_first": "“先问这个位置需要‘开头、桥梁还是收尾’。”",
  "sort_order": 1034,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1471
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "空位可能在段首、段中或段尾；不同位置承担的功",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1472
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "能不同。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1473
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1474
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Position function：句子位置会限制其功能。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1475
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先问这个位置需要‘开头、桥梁还是收尾’。”",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1476
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 段首更常总起，段中更常承接，段尾更常总结/结果。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1477
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1478
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 段首空：先读后面2-3句，概括本段主题。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1479
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 段中空：同时读空前和空后，找两边关系。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1480
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 段尾空：看本段是否需要总结、结果或过渡下一段。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1481
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 把候选句放回去，检查位置功能是否自然。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1482
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1483
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1484
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1485
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 段首出现 this/these 但前文无指代 → 高风险",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1486
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 段尾突然引入全新主题 → 高风险",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1487
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 段中能同时接住前后两边 → 强证据",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1488
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 放回后段落功能完整，没有突然跳话题。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1489
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个句子都语法通时，比较“哪个更像这个位置应该承担的功能”。",
      "sourcePage": 53,
      "sourceIndex": 1490
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1491
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "段首后面连续解释三种学习方法，则空更可能是“Here are three practical ways...”类总起，而不是某个",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1492
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "具体例子。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1493
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1494
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只看空前一句。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1495
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略段落位置功能。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1496
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1497
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 它像开头/桥梁/结尾吗？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1498
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 放进去后段落主题稳定吗？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1499
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1500
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1501
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1502
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 先判位置，再判内容。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1503
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1505
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 段首空最先看什么？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1506
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 段中空最重要范围？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1507
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 段尾空常承担？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1508
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 选项像主题句但放段中很突兀，怎么办？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1509
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 位置判断与语义哪个优先？",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1510
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 本段后文主题+上一段衔接。；2. 空前+空后。；3. 总结/结果/收束/过渡。；4. 检查位置功能，可能不",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1511
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "合位。；5. 两者都要成立。",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1512
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— G1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“G1”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 54,
      "sourceIndex": 1513
    }
  ],
